Package: MultiMAP
Title: Simultaneous Credible Intervals Using Meta-Analytic Predictive Prior Distributions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Max", family = "Menssen",
           email = "max.menssen@med.uni-goettingen.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simultaneous credible intervals for multi-arm studies that
    incorporate historical controls or other external data via meta-analytic predictive (MAP)
    prior distributions. Also provides MAP-based prediction intervals for a
    quality check of the concurrent control, as desired by many OECD test
    guidelines for regulatory toxicology studies. Normally distributed, binomial
    and Poisson endpoints are supported.
